{
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "throw_in_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "throw_in",
   "text": "And we're under way.",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "throw_in_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "throw_in",
   "text": "The referee throws it in, and off we go.",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "throw_in_a3",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "throw_in",
   "text": "Seventy minutes of hurling, and it starts now.",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "throw_in_a4",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "throw_in",
   "text": "Up goes the sliotar, and battle is joined.",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "throw_in_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "throw_in",
   "text": "First few minutes, Mick, it's all about settling. Get a touch, get a score.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "throw_in_b2",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "throw_in",
   "text": "Whoever wins the breaking ball early will grow into this.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "throw_in_b3",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "throw_in",
   "text": "Plenty of nerves out there. A good first puck-out will calm them.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "second_half_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "second_half",
   "text": "And the second half is under way.",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "second_half_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "second_half",
   "text": "Thirty-five minutes left. Here we go again.",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "second_half_a3",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "second_half",
   "text": "Back out they come, and the throw-in starts the second half.",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "second_half_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "second_half",
   "text": "Whatever was said in that dressing room, Mick, we'll see it in the next ten minutes.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "second_half_b2",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "second_half",
   "text": "The first score of this half will be huge.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "half_time_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "half_time",
   "text": "And there's the whistle for half time.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "half_time_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "half_time",
   "text": "Half time, and plenty for both managers to think about.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "half_time_a3",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "half_time",
   "text": "The referee calls a halt. That's the first half done.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "half_time_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "half_time",
   "text": "Good half of hurling, Mick. Not much between them.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "half_time_b2",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "half_time",
   "text": "They'll want more ball into the full-forward line in the second half.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "half_time_b3",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "half_time",
   "text": "The puck-outs will decide this one. Whoever wins their own will kick on.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "full_time_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "full_time",
   "text": "And there's the final whistle!",
   "tone": "big",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "full_time_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "full_time",
   "text": "It's all over! What a game of hurling.",
   "tone": "big",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "full_time_a3",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "full_time",
   "text": "The referee blows it up. They'll be celebrating long into the night.",
   "tone": "big",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "full_time_a_c4",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "full_time",
   "text": "have won it! The final whistle goes, and they've done it!",
   "tone": "big",
   "after": "county"
  },
  {
   "id": "full_time_a_c5",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "full_time",
   "text": "are the winners! What a performance from them today.",
   "tone": "big",
   "after": "county"
  },
  {
   "id": "full_time_a_c6",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "full_time",
   "text": "hold on! It's all over, and the day is theirs.",
   "tone": "big",
   "after": "county"
  },
  {
   "id": "full_time_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "full_time",
   "text": "Deserved, Mick. They worked harder for every ball.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "full_time_b2",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "full_time",
   "text": "That's a team that never stopped running. Great credit to them.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "full_time_b3",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "full_time",
   "text": "Some hurling. The supporters got their money's worth today.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "full_time_draw_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "full_time_draw",
   "text": "And it ends level! Neither side could be separated.",
   "tone": "big",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "full_time_draw_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "full_time_draw",
   "text": "The final whistle, and honours even.",
   "tone": "big",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "full_time_draw_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "full_time_draw",
   "text": "A draw is about right, Mick. Nothing between them all day.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "full_time_draw_b2",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "full_time_draw",
   "text": "Neither side will be happy with that, and neither deserved to lose.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "extra_time_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "extra_time",
   "text": "Level at the end of normal time. We're going to extra time.",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "extra_time_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "extra_time",
   "text": "Extra time, and tired legs all over the field.",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "extra_time_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "extra_time",
   "text": "It's about who has the most left in the legs now, Mick.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "shootout_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "shootout",
   "text": "Still level. It comes down to penalties.",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "shootout_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "shootout",
   "text": "A shoot-out to settle it. Nerves of steel needed now.",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "shootout_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "shootout",
   "text": "Pick your spot and hit it hard. That's all you can do, Mick.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "goal_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "goal",
   "text": "Goal! It's in the back of the net!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "goal_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "goal",
   "text": "Oh, it's a goal! What a finish!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "goal_a3",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "goal",
   "text": "Goal! The net is bulging!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "goal_a4",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "goal",
   "text": "He buries it! Goal!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "goal_a5",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "goal",
   "text": "Into the corner! A goal!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "goal_a6",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "goal",
   "text": "Green flag! What a goal!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "goal_a_n7",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "goal",
   "text": "goes for goal... and finds the net!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": "name"
  },
  {
   "id": "goal_a_n8",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "goal",
   "text": "the shot... and it's a goal!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": "name"
  },
  {
   "id": "goal_a_n9",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "goal",
   "text": "bangs it home! A goal!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": "name"
  },
  {
   "id": "goal_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "goal",
   "text": "Clinical, Mick. Head down, picked his spot, no keeper stops that.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "goal_b2",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "goal",
   "text": "That's what happens when you give a forward a yard of space.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "goal_b3",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "goal",
   "text": "The run off the shoulder did it. Nobody tracked him in.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "goal_b4",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "goal",
   "text": "The keeper had no chance. Too close, too much power.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "Over the bar.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "And that's a point.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_a3",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "Split the posts.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_a4",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "White flag. Lovely point.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_a5",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "Up and over. Point.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_a6",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "Clipped over the bar.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_a_n7",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "over the bar.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": "name"
  },
  {
   "id": "point_a_n8",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "and he splits the posts.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": "name"
  },
  {
   "id": "point_a_n9",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "points. Lovely.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": "name"
  },
  {
   "id": "point_a_n10",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "takes his point.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": "name"
  },
  {
   "id": "point_a_n11",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "nice and easy, over the bar.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": "name"
  },
  {
   "id": "point_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "Lovely score, Mick. Took his time, never rushed it.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_b2",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "That's the work rate that gets you scores.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_b3",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "Good movement. Got the half yard and punished them.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_b4",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "point",
   "text": "Easy for him in the end. Great ball in.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_long_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point_long",
   "text": "From all of seventy metres! What a point!",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_long_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point_long",
   "text": "From way out the field! Over the bar!",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_long_a3",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point_long",
   "text": "A massive strike! That's a huge point!",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_long_a_n4",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point_long",
   "text": "from distance... and it's over! What a score!",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": "name"
  },
  {
   "id": "point_long_a_n5",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point_long",
   "text": "lets fly from way out... over the bar!",
   "tone": "lift",
   "after": "name"
  },
  {
   "id": "point_long_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "point_long",
   "text": "Some striking, Mick. You don't see many from that range.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_long_b2",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "point_long",
   "text": "He just backed himself. When you hit it that sweet, it carries.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_long_b3",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "point_long",
   "text": "That's a point that lifts a whole team.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_free_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point_free",
   "text": "The free is over.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_free_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point_free",
   "text": "Pointed. No mistake from the free.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_free_a3",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point_free",
   "text": "Dead centre. The free is converted.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_free_a4",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point_free",
   "text": "Over it goes. The free taker is on song.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_free_a_n5",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point_free",
   "text": "makes no mistake with the free.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": "name"
  },
  {
   "id": "point_free_a_n6",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "point_free",
   "text": "over the bar from the placed ball.",
   "tone": "call",
   "after": "name"
  },
  {
   "id": "point_free_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "point_free",
   "text": "Routine, but you still have to strike it, Mick.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "point_free_b2",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "point_free",
   "text": "Great technique. Up, toss, strike, every time the same.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "wide_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "wide",
   "text": "And it's wide.",
   "tone": "flat",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "wide_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "wide",
   "text": "Pulled wide. A chance gone.",
   "tone": "flat",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "wide_a3",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "wide",
   "text": "Drifting... and wide.",
   "tone": "flat",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "wide_a4",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "wide",
   "text": "The umpire waves it wide.",
   "tone": "flat",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "wide_a5",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "wide",
   "text": "Wide. He'll be disappointed with that one.",
   "tone": "flat",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "wide_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "wide",
   "text": "Snatched at it, Mick. He'd want that back.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "wide_b2",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "wide",
   "text": "Bad option. There was a man free inside.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "wide_b3",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "wide",
   "text": "Hit it under pressure. You'll miss those.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "save_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "save",
   "text": "Saved! What a stop!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "save_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "save",
   "text": "And the goalkeeper keeps it out!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "save_a3",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "save",
   "text": "Brilliant save!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "save_a4",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "save",
   "text": "Denied by the keeper!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "save_a_n5",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "save",
   "text": "with a magnificent save!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": "name"
  },
  {
   "id": "save_a_n6",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "save",
   "text": "gets down to it! Saved!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": "name"
  },
  {
   "id": "save_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "save",
   "text": "Stood up big, Mick. Made himself as wide as the goal.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "save_b2",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "save",
   "text": "That's a match-winning save, that.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "save_b3",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "save",
   "text": "Great reactions. He didn't commit until the last moment.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "post_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "post",
   "text": "Off the post!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "post_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "post",
   "text": "Rattles the woodwork!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "post_a3",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "post",
   "text": "Off the upright! So close!",
   "tone": "shout",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "post_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "post",
   "text": "Inches, Mick. That's the game of hurling.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "post_b2",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "post",
   "text": "He'll see that one hitting the post in his sleep tonight.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "free_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "free",
   "text": "The referee gives a free.",
   "tone": "flat",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "free_a2",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "free",
   "text": "Whistle. Free given.",
   "tone": "flat",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "free_a3",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "free",
   "text": "And it's a free.",
   "tone": "flat",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "free_a4",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "free",
   "text": "The referee spotted that one. Free.",
   "tone": "flat",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "free_b1",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "free",
   "text": "Soft enough free, Mick, but you can't pull across a man like that.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "free_b2",
   "who": "B",
   "on": "free",
   "text": "Careless. You give away frees like that and they punish you.",
   "tone": "warm",
   "after": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "penalty_a1",
   "who": "A",
   "on": "penalty",
